<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>defaults</key>
	<string>com.guhailong.splitscreen</string>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>键盘弹出时浮窗自动上移：收到键盘通知就按键盘高度把浮窗上移，键盘收起回原位。探针：键盘通知由被托管 App 行程发，可能到不了 SpringBoard，收不到就不动，需真机验证。</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>浮窗键盘设置</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.guhailong.splitscreen.prefschanged</string>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.guhailong.splitscreen</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>keyboardAvoidEnabled</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>键盘弹出时浮窗自动上移</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>探针：键盘通知由 App 行程发，可能到不了 SpringBoard；收到了窗才上移、收起回原位，收不到就不动。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>内弹出＝键盘出现在浮窗内、浮窗为它上移；外弹出＝键盘出现在浮窗外、浮窗不动。两种都走键盘通知监听，通知到不了 SpringBoard 就不动（探针）。</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>浮窗键盘弹出方式</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.guhailong.splitscreen.prefschanged</string>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSLinkListCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string>inner</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.guhailong.splitscreen</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>keyboardPopupMode</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>浮窗键盘弹出方式</string>
			<key>validTitles</key>
			<array>
				<string>浮窗内弹出</string>
				<string>外弹出</string>
			</array>
			<key>validValues</key>
			<array>
				<string>inner</string>
				<string>outer</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.guhailong.splitscreen.prefschanged</string>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.guhailong.splitscreen</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>closeWindowOnExternalKeyboardHide</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>外置键盘收起同时关闭浮窗</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>只在外弹出模式下生效；键盘收起时活动浮窗一起关掉。横屏＋外弹出时，外置键盘可以拖动移位置（探针：SpringBoard 侧能不能动到键盘视窗未证实）。</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
	<key>title</key>
	<string>浮窗键盘设置</string>
